{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50917","headline":"句 · 李建勳","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一人看上马，双节引还乡。\n（同前。\n）（〖1〗《江南余载》：宋齐丘出镇洪州，诏赐锦袍，烈祖〖李昪〗亲爲衣之。\n李建勳赠诗有「一人看上马，双节引还乡」之句，时论荣之。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李建勳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50917.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50917","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}